{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05286","headline":"陪幸五王宅 · 萧至忠","name":"陪幸五王宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北斗枢机任，西京肺腑亲。\n畴昔王门下，今兹制幸晨。\n恩来山水被，圣作管弦新。\n遶座薰红药，当轩暗绿筠。\n摘荷才早夏，听鸟尚余春。\n行漏金徒晓，风烟是观津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧至忠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05286.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05286","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}